								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1492.msg16101#msg16101">Re: Dang Fabled and being KSed</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #17 on:</b> April 01, 2005, 08:21:10 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Yes, Vand sounds like a lack,&nbsp; of a sense of humor.&nbsp; &nbsp;<br /><br />Then, what might you expect from a necro who likes to kill druids&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm13.gif" alt="cwm13" border="0" /><br /><br />
						</td>
