								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=875"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1492.msg16106#msg16106"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1492.msg16106#msg16106">Re: Dang Fabled and being KSed</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #18 on:</b> April 01, 2005, 10:59:23 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							If I call for a camp check and some ass clown says &quot;the whole zone&quot;&nbsp; I&#039;m going to move to the mob I intended to kill, if said ass clown isn&#039;t there. I&#039;ll take it. plain and simple.<br /><br /> Nost even&nbsp; asked to be on a &quot;list&quot; instead of just taking the mob for himself, he still got shit.&nbsp; Yep sounds talbone is a real &quot;funny&quot; guy.<br /><br /><br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
