							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Yep, &quot;everything&quot;, &quot;the whole zone&quot;, and &quot;whatever I see&quot; are not acceptable answers to a camp check, and they&#039;re not particularly funny.&nbsp; Monopolizing a whole zone isn&#039;t cool, even if you can pull all the camps.&nbsp; Call the camp that you want and share the others.<br />
