								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1108"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1492.msg16115#msg16115"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1492.msg16115#msg16115">Re: Dang Fabled and being KSed</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #22 on:</b> April 01, 2005, 01:58:21 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Dont u find it funny how people will only copy paste the logged text that want u all to see, Why didnt u Post the text where u said in OOC how u&nbsp; would like to see me out DPS ur group when u come down and take the camp from me , where was this logged text at , but instead u want to just put the stuff down that makes me look like the bad person, like vanda said earlyer U&nbsp; must be so uptight that u cant take a joke , and i know u are mad cause u didnt get the camp that u wanted when u got to KC,&nbsp; SOE does say there are no such thing as camps its the first one to engage the mob that has the rights to that mob, But its out of respect out of one and other (well most of us that play there are still some that dont respect other players) that&nbsp; when a camp check is called that the group doesnt still go try to take that camp. People need to relize that there is more to Ever quest then loots that u need to act like children over just cause u cant get them, Some people take this game way too seriuos and it causes Stuff like this to happen , If u want an apolagee&nbsp; then yes ill give u one , im sorry that u cant take a joke , Im sorry that this BS has gone this far&nbsp; i mean holy crap the post wasnt even about&nbsp; Talbone and the other members of the group. You have one mad person cause they couldnt get a camp had to start something. Fabled mobs seem to cause nothing but trouble ,&nbsp; heck i wasnt even there for the dang bracer i was there helping out a friend get hers&nbsp; cause thats what i base my EQ experiance on helping out others even if it means camping a mob for 7 long hours not getting no xp out of it im happy just seeing that tell saying thanks Talbone for helping me out thats all i need to put a smile on my face, Everyone can flame if they want i dont really care cause when i log on EQ i know ill have all my friends waiting for me&nbsp; and thats all i need to make my EQ experiance worth while , Id take friends over loots any day <br /><br /><br />Talbone <br />70 necromancer<br /> 
						</td>
					</tr>
