								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Ldian were u there in KC by chance?<br /><br />Thats what i dont get is these people that want to make comments that werent even in the zone to see what realyl went on, there are always 2 sides to every story&nbsp; u all read what nos wanted u to read&nbsp; so those that werent there want to make comments on that but if u werent there and want to make bad comments about other players then&nbsp; whats the point cause u we not there .
