	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16129"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=875" title="View the profile of Ldian">Ldian</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 22<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=875"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1492.msg16129#msg16129"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1492.msg16129#msg16129">Re: Dang Fabled and being KSed</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #28 on:</b> April 01, 2005, 03:40:51 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Nope, wasn&#039;t there. I just happen to know Nost,  and find it very unlikley that he would say&quot; Watch me out DPS your group&quot;. <br /><br />I&#039;m posting because what regardless of what I saw, you calling the whole zone is BS. It might have been funny if you said &quot;the whole zone&quot; and then really stated what camp you were at.  <br /><br />The reason I even bothered posting is you continued to be a &quot;funny guy&quot; after he asked twice in ooc, and when he was nice enough to ask to be put on a list you still continued to be an ass hat.  If he did say what you claimed, then you more than likley deserved it for being annoying.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16135"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=303" title="View the profile of Soupy Sales">Soupy Sales</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 90<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus1.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=303"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1492.msg16135#msg16135"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1492.msg16135#msg16135">Re: Dang Fabled and being KSed</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #29 on:</b> April 01, 2005, 05:03:07 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							just to derail this thread to the core problem with fabled...Every one against lists (remember there used to be waiting lists to get into the regular fbss group because it was camped 24/7), seems to have a guild to back them up.<br /><br />I view these lists as giant pick up raids. I think they&#039;re a good thing, that allow solo people a chance to get loot otherwise out of their reach. Just because one or two people abuse the system doesn&#039;t mean it should be scraped. I alternated with my brother last year for just a touch of 24 hours to get his 59th ranger the fabled fbss. I don&#039;t think there were more than 3 or 4 people under 50th in the line while i was there (20 people or so on the list at all times) and most of those were alts that logged on higher level guys to help with the kill.<br /><br />Contrary to what alot of you pixilated personalities think, it doesn&#039;t hurt you to be nice to those that don&#039;t have the guild tag you have. Just because you can envoke PnP doesn&#039;t mean you should.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Prester John, 70 cleric, Dawning Nemesis<br /><br />Yes, I know, it&#039;s not the truth, but in a great history little truths can be altered so that the greater truth emerges.<br />-- Baudolino, Umberto Eco
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
